W AX3039 370-mixed-warning-error.ax:5:6-7 axtag-key-typo "AXTAG key typo on `w`: unrecognised key `restrct`; did you mean `restrict`?" ?"an unrecognised key is recorded and never checked, so the claim this looks like was not made; the keys that are checked are `effect(...)` (purity is `effect(pure)`), `restrict(...)`, `pre(...)`, `post(...)`, `isr` and `unhandled(trap)` on an `effect` declaration"
E AX3006 370-mixed-warning-error.ax:15:6-10 duplicate-definition "duplicate definition `main`" #"`main` redefined here" ^12:6-10:"`main` first defined here" ?"rename one of the definitions, or remove the duplicate"
